      "source": "https://www.unionvilleny.org/Site/Home.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Today the village thrives as a quiet bedroom community, offering a peaceful retreat close to larger commercial centers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
